    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tesla 哨兵模式成功捕捉肇事逃逸　車主黃大仙停車遭撞靠證據找回對方</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/01/24/tesla-sentry-mode-captures-hit-and-run-hk/life-tech/auto/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=tesla-sentry-mode-captures-hit-and-run-hk</link>
      <description>有網民日前於黃大仙兩館停車場遭遇 Hit and Run（肇事逃逸），車頭嚴重破損，幸獲 Tesla 的 Sentry Mode（哨兵模式）完整記錄撞擊過程，成功拍下肇事車牌，之後亦對方車主亦回到事故現場處理。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/01/24/tesla-sentry-mode-captures-hit-and-run-hk/life-tech/auto/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=tesla-sentry-mode-captures-hit-and-run-hk</guid>
